01:07:23.081 --> 01:07:23.957
Longitude!

799
01:07:28.712 --> 01:07:32.883
Are you something like this?
Didn’t you see the round thing?

800
01:07:33.884 --> 01:07:36.261
When you open the egg, a clock appears.

801
01:07:37.262 --> 01:07:38.555
Something like this? The round one?

802
01:07:38.638 --> 01:07:40.056
Oh, did you see it?

803
01:07:41.433 --> 01:07:42.726
Is there a watch that looks like that?

804
01:07:42.809 --> 01:07:45.437
Baby, read a book

805
01:07:45.520 --> 01:07:49.065
In that Christmas gift storybook
There's a watch that comes out, this...

806
01:07:49.149 --> 01:07:51.485
Inside the suit
Carrying it around like this

807
01:07:51.568 --> 01:07:56.114
Oh, that woman cut her hair
Buy me a watch strap and that?

808
01:07:56.198 --> 01:07:57.491
Oh, did you see it or not?

809
01:07:57.574 --> 01:07:58.533
I didn't see it

810
01:07:59.743 --> 01:08:01.286
It's strange

811
01:08:02.120 --> 01:08:04.623
Did a petty thief steal it or something?

812
01:08:55.799 --> 01:08:57.968
I know it's really hard

813
01:08:58.051 --> 01:08:59.803
Whether I drink alcohol or take drugs

814
01:08:59.886 --> 01:09:01.888
- Just live without paying attention.
- Hey there.

815
01:09:01.972 --> 01:09:05.016
Yes, you and Seo Ji-woo
We need to stop getting involved.

816
01:09:05.892 --> 01:09:07.477
There are people who cannot live in moderation.

817
01:09:07.561 --> 01:09:09.104
Seo Ji-woo and Lee Kyung are also like these kids.

818
01:09:09.187 --> 01:09:10.272
Hey, hey

819
01:09:11.022 --> 01:09:12.899
I keep coming here

820
01:09:13.692 --> 01:09:15.110
you're not here anymore

821
01:09:16.695 --> 01:09:18.280
grunting kindness

822
01:09:19.197 --> 01:09:20.740
worried eyes

823
01:09:20.824 --> 01:09:22.409
I keep imagining it

824
01:09:24.244 --> 01:09:26.830
Now if you catch me again
At that time, you are also confused.

